     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.52,
     "height": 0.26
    }
   ],
   "line": "Out of the night that covers me, / Black as the pit from pole to pole, / I thank whatever gods may be / For my unconquerable soul."
  },
  {
   "id": "head-unbowed",
   "image": "02-head-unbowed.png",
   "lines": 4,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.45,
    "y": 0.25
   },
   "textPreset": "searchlight-scan",
   "transitionMs": 1000,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.24,
     "y": 0.05,
     "width": 0.68,
     "height": 0.12
    }
   ],
   "line": "In the fell clutch of circumstance / I have not winced nor cried aloud. / Under the bludgeonings of chance / My head is bloody, but unbow'd."
  },
  {
   "id": "strait-gate",
   "image": "03-strait-gate.png",
   "lines": 6,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.38,
    "y": 0.35
   },
   "textPreset": "ridge-reveal",
   "transitionMs": 1100,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.42,
     "y": 0.06,
     "width": 0.5,
     "height": 0.22
    }
   ],
   "line": "Beyond this place of wrath and tears / Looms but the Horror of the shade, / And yet the menace of the years / Finds and shall find me unafraid. / It matters not how strait the gate, / How charged with punishments the scroll,"
  },
  {
   "id": "captain-of-my-soul",
   "image": "04-captain-of-my-soul.png",
   "lines": 2,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 0.3
   },
   "textPreset": "farewell-drift",
   "transitionMs": 1300,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.42,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.5,
     "height": 0.18
    }
   ],
   "line": "I am the master of my fate: / I am the captain of my soul."
  }
 ]
}